OL,5,G0900 All Things Considered
OL,6,     FTir Dewi, a Welsh charity
OL,7,     Fsupporting farmers, has been
OL,8,     Fnominated for the BBC 'Make a
OL,9,     FDifference' Awards. Rosa Hunt
OL,10,     Fexplores the challenges farmers
OL,11,     Fface and how Tir Dewi can help.
OL,12,G0933 Mal Pope's Solid Gold Sunday
OL,13,     FMal Pope is in for Owen. It's
OL,14,     Fnonstop music all the way, with
OL,15,     Fclassics from the 60s, 70s and
OL,16,     F80s, plus your dedications!
OL,17,G1200 Robin Morgan
OL,18,     FRobin brings you the best in music
OL,19,     Fand guests for your Sunday
OL,20,     Fafternoon. Call 03700 100 110 Text
OL,21,     F81012 or message us via X
OL,22,     F@bbcradiowales.
