OL,5,G1500 Lynn Bowles
OL,6,     FMusic, entertainment and great
OL,7,     Fguests for your Sunday afternoon.
OL,8,G1700 Roy Noble
OL,9,     FRoy is joined by Gareth Jones from
OL,10,     Fthe Owain Glynd?r Society to look
OL,11,     Fahead to Owain Glynd?r Day, and
OL,12,     Ftalks to Beverley Humphreys about
OL,13,     Fher Great American Songbook
OL,14,     Fchoice.
OL,15,G1900 Monitoring the Welsh Coast
OL,16,     FAli Kedge finds out how this small
OL,17,     Fresearch centre is gathering and
OL,18,     Fdelivering crucial coastal
OL,19,     Finformation in a variety of ways
OL,20,     Fand takes a different look at the
OL,21,     FWelsh coastline.
